---

TASK: Generate complete manufacturing documentation for factory production.

GARMENT SPEC:
{{ spec | tojson(indent=2) }}

GENERATE:
1. recommended_machines — List each machine type needed (e.g. "Single-needle lockstitch", "Overlock 5-thread", "Button-hole machine")
2. needle_specification — Needle type, size, point type for main fabric
3. thread_specification — Thread type, count, color codes
4. stitch_types — Each seam type: { seam_name, stitch_type, spi, tension }
5. spi — Default stitches per inch for this garment
6. seam_types — List of seam constructions used (plain, French, flat-fell, overlock, etc.)
7. estimated_sam — Standard Allowed Minutes for production (be realistic)
8. cutting_instructions — Fabric cutting sequence and grain line directions
9. ironing_instructions — Temperature, steam setting, pressing sequence
10. packaging_instructions — Folding method, tissue paper, hanger or flat
11. quality_checklist — Minimum 12 QC inspection points

Use Indian garment industry standards where applicable.
Return ONLY valid JSON.
